# 📊 Sales Analysis Dashboard | Microsoft Excel

## 📌 Project Overview

This is my personal Sales Analysis Dashboard project, created and designed entirely by me using Microsoft Excel.

The dashboard provides an interactive overview of sales performance, profit, orders, quantity sold, discount patterns, regional sales, product categories, customer segments, and shipping performance.

It transforms sales data into meaningful visual insights through charts, KPI cards, and interactive slicers.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze overall sales and profit performance.
- Track total orders and quantity sold.
- Explore sales and profit trends over time.
- Compare performance across product categories.
- Analyze regional sales performance.
- Understand customer segment contributions.
- Explore shipping mode performance.
- Examine discount patterns.

---

